# Stray duplicate of the corpus PDF at the repo root; the canonical copy is
# psy-lehrprojekt-backend-main/resources/kb/hyptest.pdf (byte-identical).
/hyptest.pdf

# Course material and anything derived from it never enters this PUBLIC repo.
# The Statistik corpus lives in ../statsbot-rag-corpus and its builds in
# ../statsbot-rag-build (tools/kb/README.md). Ignored by type, anywhere in the
# tree, so a copied file is caught even in an unexpected folder. The already
# public pilot PDF stays tracked; ignore rules never untrack a file.
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.jasp
*.f32
*.enc
